{"unit_id": "yishuiliufang__dsh-relaunch#feature-restart-route", "repo": "yishuiliufang/dsh-relaunch", "commit": "0b2ed9bf9f66290fc67dfa0971d67ce319936753", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-relaunch 的功能「接收重启请求」：Host 注入 webServer 后注册精确路径 `/dsh-relaunch/restart`。路由只接受 POST，读取可选延迟参数并将其限制在 1 到 30 秒，再调用重启启动器。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:136-208"]}
